    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "bearing witness... that sounds so exhausting though. like, why would anyone want to stay and just watch the slow decay of everything they love? if you knew for a fact that the ship was sinking and there was no lifeboat, wouldn't it be more rational to just... not go through the agony of the sinking? it seems like there's a certain dignity in just opting out before the worst of it happens.",
